WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:04.390
Would you PLEASE let go of me!

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:08.760
Then, why don't we switch places?

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.920
Ayukawa's mind could be...

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.270
...peeked into real good!

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:17.230
Maybe the one he's with all the time
isn't THIS oneechan.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.670
I've become... Kazuya!

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.980
Ayukawa!

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.730 --> 00:02:09.070
Kyosuke's Become a Kid!
Getting Super Close to Madoka.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:12.500
Ayukawa!
Kyosuke's Become a Kid!
Getting Super Close to Madoka.

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:16.960
Er... well, what I mean is...
Will you wait a sec!

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:20.610
They told me that they wanted to
look through it for a moment, so...

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:24.040
Er...

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:27.120
"Look through it for a moment?" Look at what happened!

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.980
"Math" "Ayukawa Madoka"

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:32.270
How dare they do this to my notebook?!

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:34.970
It's your fault, Kasuga,
for not refusing their request!

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.620
A...Ayukawa! Wait!

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:40.960
Would you PLEASE let go of me?!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:47.420
Ow... A...Ayukawa!

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:50.650
Oh? Oniichan and Madoka are...?

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:52.490
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:54.560
Still, Kasuga is to blame as well.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:59.410
He lent Ayukawa's notebook
to other girls without asking her!

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:01.090
Uh-huh!

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:04.970
Like, when us guys lent him a video,
it never came back!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:06.680
Really, what's with th...

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:11.410
So, I see! Kasuga isn't back yet, eh?

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:14.150
Y'know, we came here
'cause we were so worried about him!

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:14.230
"-niichan:" short version of "Oniichan" (big brother)

00:03:14.230 --> 00:03:19.670
Liar! You knew Kyosuke-niichan wouldn't be here!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:26.160
What the! A Mini Mini-Kasuga?!

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:29.700
He's our cousin Kazuya.
He just moved in next door.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:35.830
Huh? Oh! Ha, what the...!
I see, a cousin, eh? No wonder!

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.970
Geez... Manami and Kurumi...

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.960
...aren't alone.

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:41.030
Huh...?!
...aren't alone.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.960
Uncle!
Huh...?!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.090
Uncle!

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:45.250
Huh? What is it, Kazuya?
Uncle!

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:45.300
Uncle!

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:46.460
Oh?

00:03:46.460 --> 00:03:46.800
Oh... Er...
Oh?

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.520
My! You were here!
Oh... Er...

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:48.610
My! You were here!

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.290
These oniichans want to talk to you.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:52.670
Why, yes!

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:53.240
How do you do.
Why, yes!

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:55.960
We'd love to chat with you, sir!
How do you do.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.890
Peepin' Tom!

00:04:17.890 --> 00:04:19.330
Gak...!
Peepin' Tom!

00:04:19.330 --> 00:04:19.380
Peepin' Tom!

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.800
If you knew that then SCRAM!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.660
Pervert!
If you knew that then SCRAM!

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:23.750
If you knew that then SCRAM!

00:04:23.750 --> 00:04:27.960
It doesn't take kids' making fun of me to realize... Oh, what can I say...

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.770
...that this habit of mine is something I'm starting to really hate...

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:39.940
Hey, you! What do you think you're doing here?!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.650
Boo!

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:49.260
K...Kazuya!

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:57.720
Gee, Oniichan, you're such a wuss!

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:01.450
Mind your own business, why don't you?!

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:05.270
What're you so scared of?! She's only a girl, after all!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:12.140
It's best to be a little aggressive with girls, y'know!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:17.110
Sometimes, a man needs to wear wolf's clothing!

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:22.240
Wh... What are they teaching you in pre-school these days?!

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:28.010
Certainly... I sometimes wish I had Kazuya's blatant assertiveness.

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:31.730
It's called being "persuasive!" "Persuasive!"

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:37.310
Oh, I forgot! You're telepathic!

00:05:38.410 --> 00:05:40.820
If I could only read people's minds...

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:44.840
...I wouldn't have to go sneaking around just to check up on Ayukawa.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:48.970
Then why don't we switch places?

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.910
What? How could we possibly do that?!

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:55.310
Don't worry. Mommy told me about it once.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.720
A...Aunty told you?

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.680
A...Anyway! How could
such a thing be possible...?!

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:06.380
S... Still... if I do switch places with Kazuya...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.170
...then Ayukawa's mind could be...

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:13.110
...peeked into real good!

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:18.040
All right now! First, breathe in deeply!
And close your eyes!

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:22.500
Breathe in deeply...

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.050
...and close my eyes, eh?

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.030
Then, grit your teeth.
...and close my eyes, eh?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:27.490
G... Grit my teeth?!
Then, grit your teeth.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:27.580
G... Grit my teeth?!

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:31.460
Just do it! You wanna know how Madoka-oneechan feels, don't you?

00:06:32.060 --> 00:06:35.930
Geez. Fine, you win.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:39.270
Here I come!

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:50.750
Oww...

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.240
Ouch!
Oww...

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:55.940
Yahoo! Darling!

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:57.910
H... Hikaru...

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:01.540
Lucky! Lucky! I was looking
everywhere for you, Darling!

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:04.160
What the...!? Hikaru...

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:05.860
Hi, Kazuya!
What the...!? Hikaru...

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:05.950
What the...!? Hikaru...

00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:09.070
You had my Darling all to yourself? Bad boy!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.010
But I'll forgive you!

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:16.470
K...Kazuya?! I've become Kazuya!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.430
You came just in time!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:23.020
I was getting tired of
babysitting Kazuya, y'know.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.610
Hikaru, let's go somewhere where we
can have some grown-up fun!

00:07:27.350 --> 00:07:30.770
K...Kazuya...

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:34.670
My, oh, my! "Grown-up fun?!"
I can't believe what you just said!

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.180
Hikaru is very happy!

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:39.660
Hey you!

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:42.180
Er... well...

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:46.780
Getting jealous in this situation is... well...

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:50.400
...basically, it's getting jealous of myself!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.960
What can you do, oniichan?

00:07:53.960 --> 00:07:56.100
K... Kazuya!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:59.320
I'll take care of
Hikaru-oneechan for ya.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:03.110
Go find out EXACTLY how Madoka-oneechan feels about you.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:07.100
See ya later, Kazuya.
Kids should play with other kids.

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.840
That's right. See ya!

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:13.600
Indeed, Kazuya and I have switched places...

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:18.340
...but he's still sending me
telepathic messages... so perhaps...

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.270
...perhaps I got...

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.350
S...SCREWED!

00:08:23.350 --> 00:08:25.370
W...Wait!

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:29.880
W... What do you want?!

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:33.030
Whoa!

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:37.170
That's for putting sand
in my pocket yesterday!

00:08:37.170 --> 00:08:40.140
You put a frog in my school bag, didn't you?!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:43.410
You put ketchup on my
pencil case, didn't you?!

00:08:43.410 --> 00:08:46.440
We've had enough of your tricks!

00:08:46.440 --> 00:08:47.600
Take that!

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:48.720
And this!
Take that!

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:48.810
Take that!

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.090
Yikes!

00:08:56.910 --> 00:09:00.360
Shit! If, after all this, I can't read Ayukawa's mind, then...

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:03.340
...what was the point of it all, anyway?!

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:09.790
Ayukawa...

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:15.960
Ayukawa!

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:27.330
If you're a kid, walking around town is pretty tough.

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.650
Oh, shoot...

00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.570
Goddammit!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:01.740
"No Parking"

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.140
Shit! Shit! Shit!
"No Parking"

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:03.700
Shit! Shit! Shit!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:30.790
Oh! Yikes! Yikes!

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.610
All right now!

00:10:42.980 --> 00:10:46.090
Geez I knew it! I can't read anything!

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:50.360
Damn you, Kazuya, you little punk!

00:10:50.360 --> 00:10:53.390
Wa... Wait a minute...

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:58.030
"Say, Madoka-oneechan,
I know you two are fighting...

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:02.550
"...but you actually love Kyosuke-niichan lots and lots, right?"

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.710
"What...? Why, you!"

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:08.740
All right! That's it!

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:15.010
Young man! You're supposed to use the crosswalk!

00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:23.180
A... Ayukawa...

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:04.770
"And I'm seeing it..."

00:12:04.770 --> 00:12:11.110
"It... It's in your eyes... the k...ketchup..."

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:15.470
I wonder if I can ever say such cool things...?

00:12:19.840 --> 00:12:21.900
H...Hikaru!

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:29.410
Gee... I would've much preferred watching "Godzilla 3-D!"

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:48.600
What gives, you little punk? Watch where you're going!

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:51.800
Hey, you!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.160
Ow! Ow! It hurts!

00:13:20.160 --> 00:13:22.460
What is it? What happened?

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:26.070
It hurts! Somebody hit me!

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:28.620
What?! There's nobody here.

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:33.000
Oh, gosh, Darling! Maybe you fell asleep and hit your head on the chair!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.910
What?!

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:39.020
You sleepy-poo! You're so cute!

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:45.200
Geez! That bastard really is a rockhead!

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:51.130
Wh...What allowance?!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:55.160
I... er... M...Me don't got...

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:58.330
Ha! If ya don't got it with ya, then go get it!

00:13:58.330 --> 00:14:02.080
What a li'l punk! You think
you can get away so easily?

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:08.550
The truth is... there's no way that I can use the Power now...

00:14:09.990 --> 00:14:10.990
Stop that!

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.960
Say what?
Stop that!

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.490
A...Ayukawa!

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:20.700
Ma-do-ka. You remembered
this oneechan's name, eh, Kazuya?

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:27.680
Oh, I forgot! I'm Kazuya now!

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:31.190
A-ha. So you're "Madoka the Pick," eh?

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:33.670
I was wondering, cuz I haven't heard much about ya lately.

00:14:33.670 --> 00:14:38.760
If you know my reputation...
then why don't you just beat it?

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:42.150
Or, perhaps I'm a fool to ask such a thing?

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:53.860
Okay, shall we get going, Kazuya?

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.910
Damn you! You think you can brush us off just like that?!

00:14:59.010 --> 00:15:02.500
A...Ayu... I mean... Oneechan...

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.780
Let's get going.

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:05.940
Hold it right there!
Let's get going.

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:09.000
Ya think you can just leave? Huh?

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:12.910
Take your hands off Ayukawa... I mean, Oneechan!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.150
What the?! Piss off, you little brat!

00:15:17.530 --> 00:15:20.500
It's so uncool to lay your hands on such a little kid as this.

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.560
You bitch!

00:15:35.880 --> 00:15:37.550
Okay, let's get going.

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:38.980
Hold it!
Okay, let's get going.

00:15:41.220 --> 00:15:43.180
Damn you!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.990
Damn you!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:51.520
Oh! Watch out!
Damn you!

00:16:02.440 --> 00:16:04.130
Yeah!

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:26.800
For the first time I'm in Ayukawa's room.

00:16:26.800 --> 00:16:30.580
I was... mesmerized by that...
how can I say it... sweet scent...

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:32.330
Here you go. Have some.

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:34.300
Huh?! Oh...
Here you go. Have some.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:39.890
What's with you? You're being a super-good boy today.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.240
What? Oh, no, not really!

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.890
To be honest... I realized just then that...

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:53.580
...I ought to become a kid every once in a while.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:57.740
But... I feel like I'm being a Peeping Tom.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.540
Say, Kazuya?

00:16:59.540 --> 00:17:02.150
Oh! So, anyway, I was, er...
Kyosuke-niichan...

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:05.030
Oh, yeah! I was looking for Kyosuke-niichan!

00:17:07.470 --> 00:17:12.460
I see. Kasuga, huh? I haven't seen him lately.

00:17:12.780 --> 00:17:15.460
D... Did you have
a fight or something? Huh?

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:21.160
Er... what I mean is... you guys are together all the time, Oneechan.

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.560
All the time, huh?

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:26.870
I wonder. Maybe the one he's with all the time isn't THIS oneechan.

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.550
What?

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:32.900
Well, I gotta get back to ABCB now!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.990
Kazuya, want me to treat you to a sundae or something?

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:44.320
Oh, gosh! Don't look at
such a silly thing as that!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:47.120
A... Ayu... I mean, Oneechan...

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:50.590
Don't tell anybody! If he hears that I've kept this picture...

00:17:50.590 --> 00:17:53.440
...he'll get the wrong idea, y'know!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:02.380
He's such a blockhead, y'know. Your oniichan, that is.

00:18:03.190 --> 00:18:07.340
It's not that... Ayukawa had something against me...

00:18:07.340 --> 00:18:08.950
On the contrary...

00:18:08.950 --> 00:18:10.300
E...Er...

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.370
Huh?
E...Er...

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:11.430
G...Good-bye!
Huh?

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.170
G...Good-bye!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:13.900
Oh!
G...Good-bye!

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:13.950
G...Good-bye!

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:17.730
W...What do you mean, "good-bye?!" H...Hey, Kazuya!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:31.240
On the contrary... she was
most definitely thinking of me!

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:35.620
"...he'll get the wrong idea, y'know!"

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:45.080
I was so glad that I
dashed out of her house...

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:47.010
...but one could conclude...

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:51.620
...that she was only keeping
the picture because she was in it.

00:18:51.620 --> 00:18:54.270
Oniichan!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:58.810
Why, you! Kazuya!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:04.200
Hey, Kazuya, you big liar!

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:06.100
C'mon! Switch us back to normal!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:09.070
I know! I've had enough of it myself!

00:19:09.070 --> 00:19:11.420
Dating is absolutely no fun at all!

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:16.090
I don't care what you think, just switch us back!

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:19.180
B... But, you see... before we do that...

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:20.920
...let me do something nice for ya!

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:21.600
What?

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:24.230
In place of you, Oniichan!
What?

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:30.710
Girls are so easy! Just kiss 'em, and it'll all be hunky-dory!

00:19:31.110 --> 00:19:34.670
Wh...What?! Don't tell me that you'd...
do that to Ayukawa?!

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:37.930
Well, you stay there for a while and see!

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:39.390
Hey, you! Stop!

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.860
Welcome! Oh... Kasuga...

00:19:45.390 --> 00:19:47.360
Are you still mad at me?

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:51.770
Where's Master?

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:55.170
Er... H... He's out shopping...
Where's Master?

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:55.940
Oh, really? Now that's perfect.
Er... H... He's out shopping...

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:57.270
Oh, really? Now that's perfect.

00:19:57.270 --> 00:19:59.240
Huh?
Oh, really? Now that's perfect.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:10.900
C'mon! Like, what's going on?!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:13.450
What do you mean?

00:20:14.360 --> 00:20:15.610
What do I mean?

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:18.410
Why don't you come sit beside me, Ayukawa?

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:20.260
I'm still working, you know.

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:22.630
It's in your eyes...
I'm still working, you know.

00:20:22.630 --> 00:20:23.220
Huh?
It's in your eyes...

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:23.310
Huh?

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:26.830
And it makes that movie some comedy.

00:20:32.980 --> 00:20:34.380
Just what's going on here?!

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:36.720
You've still got ketchup on your nose.
Just what's going on here?!

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:39.010
What?! Kasuga!
You've still got ketchup on your nose.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:43.710
Ayukawa...

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:55.420
Ayukawa, close your eyes.

00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:57.450
Wh... Why?!

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.290
It's all right. This is how it went in the movie.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.890
"Movie?!"

00:21:04.370 --> 00:21:06.340
Ayukawa...

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:13.050
Is this jerk... trying to make up with me?

00:21:13.920 --> 00:21:17.440
Ushiko, wherefore art thou, Ushiko?

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:20.510
And Umao, wherefore art thou, Umao?

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:23.860
Outta my way! Outta my way!

00:21:36.440 --> 00:21:37.210
Ushiko...

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:37.900
Umao...
Ushiko...

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:43.040
Outta my way! Outta my way!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.140
Ayukawa!

00:21:57.390 --> 00:21:59.950
Goddammit!

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:13.940
Oh, no, you won't!

00:22:17.350 --> 00:22:22.750
Take this! I may not be able to use telepathy...
but I can teleport!

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:35.990
H... Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:22:37.430 --> 00:22:41.540
Damn, that hurt! Boy, that was something!

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:45.040
Ayukawa! Wanna eat burgers
or something before we leave?

00:22:45.410 --> 00:22:48.380
To make up, y'know. Maybe we could have a bite somewhere...

00:22:54.220 --> 00:22:56.180
Oneech...

00:23:00.590 --> 00:23:04.460
I forgot... I'm not Kazuya anymore!

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:09.120
You're the worst!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.400
I, Kasuga Kyosuke... wished that I could have remained as... a kid.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.530
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.530 --> 00:23:44.780
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.780 --> 00:23:49.120
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.120 --> 00:23:53.350
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.350 --> 00:24:01.230
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:10.730
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:18.540
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:27.220
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:36.930
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.930 --> 00:24:45.310
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.310 --> 00:24:49.640
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:53.980
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.980 --> 00:24:58.280
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.280 --> 00:25:02.620
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.620 --> 00:25:07.440
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:13.020 --> 00:25:15.010
Ayukawa got hurt!

00:25:15.010 --> 00:25:17.540
If I take care of her,
and help her out with this and that...

00:25:17.540 --> 00:25:19.150
...maybe there'll be a chance for us to be alone!

00:25:19.690 --> 00:25:22.180
Or, is it... shameful of me to think such a thing?

00:25:22.180 --> 00:25:22.230
"Sukeban:" Young female punks.

00:25:22.230 --> 00:25:26.560
But, the Sukeban girls are
apparently after Ayukawa.
"Sukeban:" Young female punks.

00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:26.610
"Sukeban:" Young female punks.

00:25:26.610 --> 00:25:30.830
Next time: "Marked Woman Madoka! Kyosuke, Proving He's a Man."
